flowchart LR
    A[Input Features] --> B[Initial Prediction]
    B --> C[Compute Errors / Residuals]
    C --> D[Train New Tree to Correct Prior Mistakes]
    D --> E[Add Tree Contribution<br/>scaled by learning rate]
    E --> F[Updated Prediction]
    F --> G{More boosting rounds?}
    G -- Yes --> C
    G -- No --> H[Final Ensemble Prediction]

    I[Regularization<br/>depth, shrinkage, subsampling, column sampling] --> D
    J[Objective Function<br/>loss + penalty] --> C